# 副簽
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:喺文件、支票等上面做第二個簽名人，以確認或授權（通常指銀行戶口需要兩個人簽名先可以動用款項）
eng:to countersign; to be a co-signatory
<eg>
yue:開公司戶口要搵多個人嚟副簽。 (hoi1 gung1 si1 wu6 hau2 jiu3 wan2 do1 go3 jan4 lai4 fu3 cim1.)
eng:You need to find another person to countersign when opening a company bank account.
<eg>
yue:呢張支票要老闆副簽先攞到錢。 (ni1 zoeng1 zi1 piu2 jiu3 lou5 baan2 fu3 cim1 sin1 lo2 dou3 cin2.)
eng:This cheque needs the boss's countersignature before you can get the money. [end of text]


